This project includes a modified version of the ASAM OpenSCENARIO 2 grammar
from PMSF py-osc2 (https://github.com/PMSFIT/py-osc2), which is licensed
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0).

Modifications:
- top-level `use` statement support
- spaced physical literals (e.g., `35 kph`)

The following files are distributed under MPL-2.0:
- grammar/openscenario2.g4
- src/osc2c/frontend/generated/*.py

MPL-2.0 full text: https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/

ASAM OpenSCENARIO DSL 2.2.0 files (grammar.ebnf, types.osc, domain.osc,
standard.osc) are not included in this repository. They are used locally
under external/asam/ (gitignored) for validation. Their headers state that,
in alteration to the regular license terms, "ASAM allows unrestricted
distribution of this standard"; the redistribution decision is still open
(see docs/GRAMMAR_DIFF_2.2.md, section 8).
